description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if there are at least 0/4 Knight/VI allies;
WS Blue: Grants [Earth Damage +30%] to party
WS Gold: Grants [Deadly Strikes +20%] to party

